### Sample requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client)
@base = http://localhost:5000

### List vehicles with live status
GET {{base}}/api/vehicles

### Report a ping as a device
POST {{base}}/api/pings
Content-Type: application/json
# X-Device-Key: change-me

{
  "deviceId": "dev-van-01",
  "timestampUtc": "2026-01-01T09:00:00Z",
  "latitude": 52.3740,
  "longitude": 4.8930,
  "speedKph": 38.5,
  "headingDegrees": 120,
  "ignitionOn": true
}

### Upload a buffered burst
POST {{base}}/api/pings/batch
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pings": [
    { "deviceId": "dev-van-02", "timestampUtc": "2026-01-01T09:00:00Z", "latitude": 52.35, "longitude": 4.85, "speedKph": 40 },
    { "deviceId": "dev-van-02", "timestampUtc": "2026-01-01T09:00:30Z", "latitude": 52.35, "longitude": 4.855, "speedKph": 42 }
  ]
}

### Draw a geofence
POST {{base}}/api/geofences
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fuel station",
  "color": "#6a1b9a",
  "alertOnEnter": true,
  "alertOnExit": false,
  "vertices": [
    { "lat": 52.3600, "lng": 4.8400 },
    { "lat": 52.3600, "lng": 4.8450 },
    { "lat": 52.3570, "lng": 4.8450 },
    { "lat": 52.3570, "lng": 4.8400 }
  ]
}

### Which fences contain a point?
GET {{base}}/api/geofences/containing?lat=52.37&lng=4.89

### Open alerts
GET {{base}}/api/alerts?unacknowledgedOnly=true

### Trips in the last 24h
GET {{base}}/api/trips
